  "//private": "PRIVATE by the locked distribution model (requirements §NG4 / AGENTS.md): the PUBLIC npm layer is ONLY tokens/tailwind-preset/utils/icons; component source + the provider ship via the private registry copy-in, not an open npm publish. Publishing this package (public OR restricted) is a distribution decision reserved for MK — do not flip without updating the locked requirements first.",
